        "Title": "Slaughter of a Scapegoat",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL_BULLDOG",
        "PublicId": "128456782746",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0f88cdaa-d784-4951-8696-ea3065cc6228).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, 47.  We traced the biochem-agent to a specific plant based strain found in the south of England. Providence had intel on one Zachary Carlisle; a poison obsessed fanatic; or he was, before his untimely death. No doubts at the hands of Pearsons, the Groundskeeper and Ford Jr., the family finnancial advisor; both have covered for Zachary&apos;s obsession. Miami drew the unwanted attention of a London PI, and they needed an out. Burry the GK and frame Ford&apos;s guard with murder-suicide.",
